;
; How Fieldguide files one article of its index in MYRA
; (fieldguide_rules.h FR4): a record under the article's place in the
; index, with the species' GBIF key (taxon, 0 not known), what it is
; (kind: 0 other, 1 plant, 2 fungus, 3 animal), the article's toxicity
; mark (1 toxic or dangerous, 0 marks neither, -1 carries nothing) and
; when the file last changed. The model asks whether the numbers fit
; before it keeps the article.
^ZXFIELDGUIDE(article:i4) = taxon:i9! ^ kind:i1! ^ mark:i1! ^ mtime:i12!
